      "pair_note_en": "Most of the evidence is for hawthorn leaf and flower extracts, not the hawthorn fruit used in soups and teas.",
      "pair_note_zh": "大部分證據係關於山楂葉同花嘅提取物，唔係煲湯或沖茶用嘅山楂果。",
      "zh_reviewed": true,
      "uses": {
        "line_en": "Health Canada says hawthorn fruit is “Traditionally used in Herbal Medicine to help maintain and/or support cardiovascular health in adults”.",
        "line_zh": "加拿大衞生部話（英文原文翻譯），山楂果「傳統上喺草藥醫學用嚟幫助成年人維持及／或支持心血管健康」。",
