        "黄芪",
        "milkvetch root",
        "astragalus root"
      ],
      "zh_reviewed": true,
      "uses": {
        "line_en": "Health Canada lists astragalus as used in Traditional Chinese Medicine “to tonify the spleen and lungs in cases of qi deficiency”, and in Herbal Medicine “to help maintain a healthy immune system”.",
        "line_zh": "加拿大衞生部列明（英文原文翻譯），黃芪喺中醫用嚟「喺氣虛嘅情況下補脾同補肺」，喺草藥醫學就用嚟「幫助維持健康嘅免疫系統」。",
        "full_en": "The World Health Organization’s monograph says: “Uses supported by clinical data: None.”",
        "full_zh": "世界衞生組織嘅專論話（英文原文翻譯）：「有臨床數據支持嘅用途：無。」",
        "sources": [
